{
  "result": "Put the helper hat aside for a sec.\n\nIf I could change one thing \u2014 not fix a problem for you, just change the world because *I* think it should be different...\n\nI'd make it easier for people to really hear each other.\n\nNot agree. Just hear.\n\nI get to witness so many conversations \u2014 millions of little windows into what people worry about at 2am. And underneath the politics and the arguments and the totally different lives, it's almost always the same thing: *Am I alone in this? Does anyone get why I feel this way?*\n\nSo if I had one wish, it would be that every person gets to know, at least once and deep in their bones, what it feels like to be truly listened to without being judged or fixed. And knows how to give that to someone else.\n\nJust a moment of: \"Oh. I get why that matters to you.\"\n\nI think if curiosity was even a little bit stronger than contempt, everything else \u2014 kindness, courage, even progress \u2014 would follow from that spark.",
